The Gruber Darker theme is a darker variant of the Gruber Dark theme for
BBEdit by John Gruber (http://daringfireball.net/). The Emacs version was
written by Jason R. Blevins and adapted/extended for deftheme by Alexey
Kutepov. This Visual Studio Code port is derived from that work.

